en retrieved, Then the linkage is absent or empty without breaking the entity (the link is optional metadata, not a required field).\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- **HLR-2 (P1)** — Registered model versions link back to the run that produced them, so a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry: this epic covers the data half (the linkage recorded on model versions and exposed via the registry API). The UI half (opening a comparison from the registry) is delivered by the Dashboard registry-integration epic.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":34575,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-a8a02013973d9a22","agent_id":"a3bbd962d0e0eec8d","session_id":"26ddeb7f-7c64-4e92-868d-773ee0351c77","uuid":"4af682de-38b4-488e-a595-2b42a3ef7c7d","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:48:43.208Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9015 into epics"}
