{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-b00e7748fd143cde","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n3\ttitle: Side-by-side and diff comparison of run parameters and metrics in the Dashboard\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P0\n9\tdependencies: []\n10\tai_signals:\n11\t  change_specificity: 0\n12\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n13\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n14\t  existing_foundation: 1\n15\t  open_questions: 1\n16\t  external_dependency: 1\n17\t  human_process_gates: 1\n18\t  repo_access: 1\n19\t  architecture_claims: 1\n20\timplementation_type: null\n21\tinvestigation_signals: null\n22\tai_implementability: High\n23\tai_implementability_score: 7\n24\tjira_key: null\n25\tbranch: null\n26\tgated_by: null\n27\tgate_failure_impact: null\n28\t---\n29\t# Side-by-side and diff comparison of run parameters and metrics in the Dashboard\n30\t\n31\t## Description\n32\t\n33\tThis epic delivers the run comparison capability in the Dashboard: users can select two or more training and pipeline runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side, and switch to a diff view that highlights which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs. This replaces the current export-to-spreadsheet workflow for comparing candidate runs during model promotion decisions.\n34\t\n35\t## Scope\n36\t\n37\t- Multi-select of runs from the runs list (covering both training and pipeline runs).\n38\t- Side-by-side view of parameters and metrics for the selected runs.\n39\t- Diff view over two selected runs that highlights which parameters and metrics changed; the diff view is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface, delivered together with the side-by-side view.\n40\t- The comparison reads the per-run parameter and metric data the Dashboard already surfaces on per-run pages; the Dashboard owns no data plane, so no new backend data store is introduced.\n41\t- Validation against Data Science Pipelines run data (passive component — no Data Science Pipelines code changes are expected): the comparison is exercised against real pipeline runs through the existing run-data surfaces.\n42\t- Out of scope: automatic best-run selection or promotion, and comparison across clusters or projects.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- Given two or more runs selected from the runs list, When the user opens the comparison, Then the parameters and metrics of all selected runs are displayed side by side.\n47\t- Given exactly two runs selected in the comparison, When the user switches to the diff view, Then every parameter and metric key present in either run is shown with changed values highlighted — measured by: the diff lists the union of keys from both runs and marks each key whose value differs.\n48\t- Given runs of both kinds, When compared, Then the comparison works for training runs and for pipeline runs — measured by: a side-by-side and a diff comparison succeeds against real pipeline runs retrieved through the existing run-data surfaces, with no Data Science Pipelines code change required.\n49\t- Given the comparison is open, When the user changes the run selection, Then the side-by-side and diff views update accordingly.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- **HLR-1 (P0)** — Users can select two or more runs and view their parameters and metrics side by side in the Dashboard: fully covered by this epic.\n54\t- **HLR-3 (P1)** — Provide a run \"diff\" view that highlights which parameters and metrics changed between two selected runs: covered by this epic, **bundled** with HLR-1. The diff view is a presentation mode of the same comparison surface over the same run data (same component, same team, same UI surface); it edits the same call sites and data structures as the side-by-side view, so splitting it out would double-touch the same surface and is not separately schedulable. The epic is prioritized at the higher of the two levels (P0).\n55\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b46478b67d6f7be","agent_id":"a95ba77cbc2c3a7cf","session_id":"26ddeb7f-7c64-4e92-868d-773ee0351c77","uuid":"907be9e6-602a-4d9d-b657-3f603ab1aa81","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:51:04.527Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-b00e7748fd143cde","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
