{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e6244d651e4b947","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tepic_id: RHAISTRAT-9015-E003\n3\ttitle: Open run comparison from the Model Registry (Dashboard registry integration)\n4\tparent_strat: RHAISTRAT-9015\n5\tcomponent: Dashboard\n6\tteam: RHOAI Dashboard\n7\ttype: Implementation\n8\tpriority: P1\n9\tdependencies:\n10\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E001\n11\t- RHAISTRAT-9015-E002\n12\tai_signals:\n13\t  change_specificity: 0\n14\t  pattern_precedent: 1\n15\t  adapter_pattern: 0\n16\t  existing_foundation: 1\n17\t  open_questions: 1\n18\t  external_dependency: 1\n19\t  human_process_gates: 1\n20\t  repo_access: 1\n21\t  architecture_claims: 1\n22\timplementation_type: null\n23\tinvestigation_signals: null\n24\tai_implementability: High\n25\tai_implementability_score: 7\n26\tjira_key: null\n27\tbranch: null\n28\tgated_by: null\n29\tgate_failure_impact: null\n30\t---\n31\t# Open run comparison from the Model Registry (Dashboard registry integration)\n32\t\n33\t## Description\n34\t\n35\tThis epic delivers the registry-side entry point for run comparison in the Dashboard: from a registered model version's view in the Model Registry UI, users can see the run that produced the version and open a run comparison populated with that run, reusing the run comparison capability already delivered for the runs list.\n36\t\n37\t## Scope\n38\t\n39\t- In the Dashboard's Model Registry model-version view, surface the originating-run linkage recorded on the model version.\n40\t- Provide an action that opens the run comparison (the side-by-side and diff capability delivered for the runs list) with the linked run pre-selected, alongside the ability to add further runs to the comparison.\n41\t- No new comparison surface is built in this epic — the registry entry point populates and navigates to the existing comparison views.\n42\t- Works for both the side-by-side mode and the diff mode of the comparison.\n43\t\n44\t## Acceptance Criteria\n45\t\n46\t- Given a registered model version that carries a run linkage, When the user views the version in the Model Registry UI, Then the originating run is shown.\n47\t- Given a registered model version that carries a run linkage, When the user opens the comparison from the registry, Then the comparison view opens with the linked run pre-selected and further runs selectable — measured by: the opened comparison displays the linked run's parameters and metrics alongside at least one other run.\n48\t- Given the comparison opened from the registry, When the user switches to the diff view with a second run selected, Then changed parameters and metrics are highlighted.\n49\t- Given a model version with no run linkage, When viewed in the registry UI, Then the comparison entry point is absent or disabled without breaking the version view.\n50\t\n51\t## HLR Traceability\n52\t\n53\t- **HLR-2 (P1)** — Registered model versions link back to the run that produced them, so a comparison can be opened from the Model Registry: this epic covers the UI half (the registry-side entry point that opens a comparison). The data half (the linkage recorded on model versions) is delivered by the Model Registry epic.\n54\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b46478b67d6f7be","agent_id":"a95ba77cbc2c3a7cf","session_id":"26ddeb7f-7c64-4e92-868d-773ee0351c77","uuid":"d94de31c-7f9c-4922-ae23-6fb741bc8b03","timestamp":"2026-10-25T17:51:08.313Z","tool_result_meta":[{"id":"chatcmpl-tool-8e6244d651e4b947","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}],"subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Review RHAISTRAT-9015 decomposition"}
